<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carbide/Graphite.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carbide/Graphite.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson Humphrey said it lowered its near-term recommendation on Carbide/Graphite Group Inc to market perform from buy, but the long-term rating remains a buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares were 2-1/4 lower to 21-3/4 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
